notterizmus (1.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Chapter list on the left (F9) with Ctrl+PgUp/PgDn for the previous
    or next chapter; drag its edge to resize it.
  * Chapter Properties (F2): rename, renumber or move a chapter to
    another book; F2 on a book renames it.
  * Reorder chapters by dragging them or with Alt+Up/Down; Delete moves
    one to the Trash, with Undo.
  * Getting Started (F1): a practice chapter that shows each control;
    About is in the menu only.
  * Chapters saved by a newer version keep unknown parts unchanged and
    show them read-only.
  * Fix GTK size warnings for table cells.

 -- Simo Andreev <simeon.zlatanov.andreev@pm.me>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 19:12:06 +0200

notterizmus (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ctrl+Space: spelling fixes and word completion; item type cycling
    moved to Ctrl+Shift+Space.
  * Number hotkeys 1-9, 0 in the Alt+Insert, item and Ctrl+Space popups.
  * The view follows the cursor, so Enter at the bottom of a full window
    no longer hides it.
  * Notes stay in the real Documents folder when running as a snap.

 -- Simo Andreev <simeon.zlatanov.andreev@pm.me>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 19:53:02 +0200

notterizmus (1.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First release: outline editor for book chapter notes. See FEATURES.md.

